#: ../../../user/templates/templates.rst:196 a1caffd37c124746a0dc5fac22f29fe6
msgid "Inheritance and persistence"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/templates.rst:198 285f11bbb3b04f58912e1d5e6b5a86b5
msgid ""
"Whenever an app qube is created, the contents of the ``/home`` directory of "
"its parent template are *not* copied to the child app qube’s ``/home``. The "
"child app qube’s ``/home`` is always independent from its parent template’s "
"``/home``, which means that any subsequent changes to the parent template’s "
"``/home`` will not affect the child app qube’s ``/home``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/templates/templates.rst:200 70bfe0c8d89a4c919c54bb9046c7ef20
msgid ""
"Once an app qube has been created, any changes in its ``/home``, ``/usr/"
"local``, or ``/rw/config`` directories will be persistent across reboots, "
"which means that any files stored there will still be available after "
"restarting the app qube. No changes in any other directories in app qubes "
"persist in this manner. If you would like to make changes in other "
"directories which *do* persist in this manner, you must make those changes "
"in the parent template."
msgstr ""

